      en: ["The plateau stands at an average elevation of 200 to 250 meters above sea level.", "It is located adjacent to the Krasnovodsk Gulf of the Caspian Sea.", "The city of Türkmenbaşy lies at the southern base of the plateau cliffs.", "Annual rainfall in this coastal desert region often falls below 120 mm.", "Limestone deposits from the Miocene and Pliocene epochs dominate its geology.", "The plateau is a key location for monitoring Caspian Sea maritime traffic."],
